# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# macOS noise
.DS_Store

# Solver toolchain: built from source (pinned commits), see docs/reproducing.md
tools/

# Large generated artifacts: CNF formulas (up to 492 MB) and DRAT proofs
# (up to 12 GB). GitHub cannot host them; they are deterministic outputs of
# the pipeline (dump_dimacs.py + CaDiCaL) and their sha256 hashes are recorded
# in results/FOUND.sha256, results/Z15-PARTIAL.md and docs/results.md.
# The small validation instances in results/dimacs/ (Z7, Z11) ARE tracked,
# so anyone can verify a real certificate in seconds without rebuilding.
results/*.cnf
results/*.drat

# Backup copies
*.bak-*
